# Generated data (not source): the SQLite DB and the pre-DB JSON history it
# superseded. Not tracked here even though Vercel deploys still need the DB
# — see .vercelignore, which deliberately does NOT exclude it, so `vercel
# --prod` (reads the local filesystem directly, not this repo) still ships
# it. Updating live data: run `npm run assess` locally, then `vercel --prod`
# again — no git commit needed for the DB itself anymore.
/data/psychochat.sqlite
/data/mock-scores.json
/data/history/

.vercel
.env*
